{"type": "CHUNK", "content": "## Institutional Quantitative Analysis\n\n### Executive Summary\n\nBased on verified DataCollector evidence:\nI am unable to produce a valid quantitative report because the request contains no verified data, no ticker, no expert committee inputs, and no evidence_ids. The quantitative engine requires structured inputs to function.\n\n### Verified Data & Evidence\n\n| Field | Status |\n|-------|--------|\n| Ticker | Missing |\n| Fundamentals | No evidence_id |\n| Quant signals | No evidence_id |\n| Risk metrics | No evidence_id |\n| 12-agent committee view | Not supplied |\n| Market data | No evidence_id |\n\n### Risk Assessment\n\nCannot compute VaR or drawdown without price series and volatility inputs.\n\n### Asymmetry and Sizing\n\nKelly Criterion and tail-risk sizing require edge probability and payoff ratio — both absent.\n\n### Patterns and Manipulation\n\nNo order flow, whale wallet, or exchange flow data provided.\n\n### Directional Thesis\n\nInsufficient data to form any directional probability distribution.\n\n### Tactical Next Step + Classification\n\n**STUDY_MORE**\n\n**Missing data required to proceed:**\n1. Ticker symbol or asset identifier\n2. Current price with evidence_id\n3. Fundamentals (P/E, EPS, revenue growth, debt/equity) with evidence_ids\n4. Quant signals (momentum, mean reversion, volume profile) with evidence_ids\n5. Risk parameters (historical volatility, beta, correlation matrix) with evidence_ids\n6. 12-agent AI committee consensus view\n7. Whale wallet / exchange flow data for manipulation guardrails\n\nThe engine is idle. Submit structured data to resume quantitative processing.", "run_id": "453d5ac3d2ae"}
